[{"answer":"Hello?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Hello? Who is this?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Hello. I'm a representative of the Tallyho Survey Company,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/3.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'd like to ask you a few questions regarding exercise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, that's an interesting subject.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, we think so, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/6.mp3"},{"answer":"But I'm afraid I'm a bit busy at the moment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't worry. This will only take about four minutes at the most.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/8.mp3"},{"answer":"It's 10:25 now, so it will all be over by 10:30.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Well... alright, if it's that short.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/10.mp3"},{"answer":"It will be.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/11.mp3"},{"answer":"So, one of the first things I need to know is where you are,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/12.mp3"},{"answer":"that is, which suburb or area of the city?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/13.mp3"},{"answer":"The last client was in Blackburn, for example.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Blackburn. That's close to me. I'm in Box Hill.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Another eastern suburb then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I have a friend in Box Hill, too. Interesting place.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, I need your approximate age for this survey.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Are you younger than 20, between 20 and 29, 30 and 39, and so on?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll turn 40 in a few months,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/20.mp3"},{"answer":"so that puts me in the 40 to 49 age group.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's in a few months, so right now you're in the 30 to 39.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, right. So put that then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay. Now, I need to know your occupation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/24.mp3"},{"answer":"The last caller was a housewife, for example; the one before that a teacher.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I used to be a teacher, too, teaching cookery.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/26.mp3"},{"answer":"And now?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Now you can just put 'domestic duties'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually, I hope to begin a new job soon, as a cook,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/29.mp3"},{"answer":"but that won't be for some time yet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I have to wait for my husband's restaurant to open.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Cook? That sounds interesting,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/32.mp3"},{"answer":"but it's 'domestic duties' for now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, that just leaves some information about your family.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/34.mp3"},{"answer":"This is not obligatory at all, so if you don't want to answer, that's fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/35.mp3"},{"answer":"What sort of information, exactly?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, it's very broad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Married, with children; single mother, that sort of thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/38.mp3"},{"answer":"The last customer said she was a single mother.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/39.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm married, and not a mother. Put 'married, no children'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/40.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm married with children, myself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/41.mp3"},{"answer":"But I'll put in your details, and that finishes the profile,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/42.mp3"},{"answer":"and just leaves the actual survey itself, if you're ready to proceed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Alright, let's begin the survey now, about your exercise habits.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/44.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm afraid I don't exercise much at all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the main question is in what form you take your exercise, however little that may be,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/46.mp3"},{"answer":"for example, in just cleaning. Do you clean the house?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/47.mp3"},{"answer":"My husband does the cleaning, actually,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/48.mp3"},{"answer":"but I walk to the supermarket and shops very often, up to four times a week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/49.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll put that then, unless there's something else.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Nothing else, really. But I diet. I'm very strict about what I eat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, and I do yoga, although that's not very energetic,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/52.mp3"},{"answer":"more a form of relaxation, and to tighten my muscles.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/53.mp3"},{"answer":"They're both important, of course,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/54.mp3"},{"answer":"but what about sport?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you undertake any sporting activities?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/56.mp3"},{"answer":"This could be very infrequent. In the past, for example.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/57.mp3"},{"answer":"My husband plays basketball at the local school, and I sometimes watch.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/58.mp3"},{"answer":"When he was younger he was in a basketball team, but I never participated.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you done anything at all?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/60.mp3"},{"answer":"I used to hike in a nearby national park.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Well that's a definite physical activity, so I'll put that - but not basketball.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Alright, that just leaves future exercise intentions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you plan, or expect to do, at some stage, any form of exercise?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/64.mp3"},{"answer":"I once dreamt of doing modern dance, but that's never going to happen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Realistically, I'm thinking about going swimming, at the local aquatic centre,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/66.mp3"},{"answer":"although my husband thinks we should just jog.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/67-2022-02-28-09-02-47.mp3"},{"answer":"I can't see myself doing that, though, too tiring.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/68.mp3"},{"answer":"I can understand.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/69.mp3"},{"answer":"I used to jog, too, and it really makes you sweat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/70.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd say swimming's a much better option.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/71.mp3"},{"answer":"But I'll be starting this job as a cook in my husband's restaurant.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/72.mp3"},{"answer":"I imagine I'll be very tired doing all those late shifts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/73.mp3"},{"answer":"But if I have any energy left over, I might go to the aquatic centre to release some stress.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Alright. Well, that's the end of the survey.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you very much for your time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-37-2022-01-02-09-58-23/76.mp3"}]
